OL,3,GNEWSATeens try music industry jobs as
OL,4,A'mini Mercuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of teenagers helped to plan and
OL,7,Fdeliver a live gig as part of a
OL,8,Fprogramme aimed at giving them a taste
OL,9,Fof music industry careers.
OL,11,FYoung people aged 15 to 16 worked
OL,12,Falongside Ant Thompson, director of
OL,13,FNewcastle-based Live Notion Events, to
OL,14,Forganise indie pop band Nano Kino's
OL,15,Fheadline gig at The Cluny on Monday.
OL,17,FThe Mini Mercury Promoters scheme is
OL,18,Fpart of the Mercury Prize fringe - run
OL,19,Fby music development agency Generator -
OL,20,Fwhich aims to create opportunities for
OL,21,Fcreatives.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
