OL,3,GNEWSATeens try music industry jobs as
OL,4,A'mini Mercuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThompson said he hoped to show young
OL,7,Fpeople what roles exist in music beyond
OL,8,Fbeing a performer, and inspire them to
OL,9,Fconsider careers "while living in the
OL,10,FNorth".
